  E4: 'no enumerated open-problem candidate commits an O2 store and a flight duration',
  E7: 'no enumerated open-problem candidate commits a death stage and a scoring stage',
  C14b: 'no enumerated open-problem candidate commits an aerobic ceiling; the physics thread\'s altitude candidates do, translated in lean/eliminate/tff-candidates.json',
